                                "sense_id": "0792d154-aa6d-381d-b1cf-a11897813b5e",
                                "text": "It's a sad fact that unplayed instruments deteriorate. Your family heirloom or investment may not after all be appreciating in value as you had hoped."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80f6afd6-21b8-467f-a00d-1f9b75a7e2d4",
                                "sense_id": "0792d154-aa6d-381d-b1cf-a11897813b5e",
                                "text": "There was still the matter of an unplayed game against Houston, an intended early-season breather that was no longer needed […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b957b1f6-da02-4625-84c3-153c4b1b00aa",
                                "sense_id": "0792d154-aa6d-381d-b1cf-a11897813b5e",
                                "text": "Usually the result is 1-0, 0-1 or ½-½. In exceptional circumstances both players may lose (Article 11.8), or one score ½ and the other 0. For unplayed games the scores are indicated by +/- (White wins by forfeit), -/+ (Black wins by forfeit), -/- (Both players lose by forfeit)."
                            }
                        ]
